---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclosure"
  description="How FKN Wine makes money, how we handle links, and the rules we follow. Full transparency, no asterisks."
>
  <section class="wrapper" style="padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; max-width: 720px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5.5vw, 2.6rem);">Disclosure</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.05rem;">
      The short version: FKN Wine is free, and when we use links that earn us a commission, we
      say so. Here's the long version.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2.25rem;">How we make money</h2>
    <p>
      FKN Wine is reader-supported. That means we may earn a commission when you buy something
      through links on this site (like wine club signups or shop offers). This costs you nothing
      extra — in most cases you pay exactly the same price, sometimes less when a link carries a
      deal.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>What commissions never do:</strong> buy a verdict. If something isn't worth your
      money, we say so, whether or not it pays us. A bad deal with a good commission is still a
      bad deal — and it's not on this site.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2.25rem;">How we mark links</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Links that can earn us a commission are marked internally as
        <em>sponsored</em> links and are covered by this disclosure page, as required by the
        FTC's endorsement guidelines.
      </li>
      <li>Links we don't earn from are just links.</li>
      <li>We never write "up to X% off" marketing math. Prices on our pages are the prices we verified on the merchant's site, with the date we checked them.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2.25rem;">What we don't do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We don't invent tastings, scores, or test results. Our content is based on verifiable information (offers, terms, published ratings) and on opinions that are clearly written as opinions.</li>
      <li>We don't sell reviews, rankings, or verdicts.</li>
      <li>We don't hide the fine print. Reading it is literally what this site is for.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2.25rem;">Alcohol</h2>
    <p>
      FKN Wine is written for adults 21 and older. We don't sell alcohol and we don't advertise
      to anyone under 21. Merchants we link to are responsible for their own age verification and
      shipping laws. Enjoy responsibly — and if alcohol isn't your thing, that's completely fine
      too.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2.25rem;">Questions</h2>
    <p>
      Mail us: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. We answer honestly.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.6;">Last updated: October 2026</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
